title: file-manager:toggle
tags: [[GUI command]] [[file-manager panel]]
kind: reference
summary: File manager: toggle a view flag (root constraint / hidden dot-entries / sort by watch activity / sort by operations written)

Flips one of the four view settings of the [[file-manager panel]], named as the argument: `root` (browse inside the repository root only, or the whole disk), `hidden` (show the dot-entries), `activity` (order the entries by watcher events, busiest first — [[Watch activity]]), `operations` (order them by what the watcher wrote to the log for them, costliest first). The two orders exclude each other.
